    "Attack Attribute": "None",
    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 This Queen of the Elves first decided to teach humans magic. Later betrayed by those humans, she was murdered following the war with the Orcs. Resurrected by Lilith, she became the ruler of the Catacomb. She was slain during Anakim's invasion of the Catacomb, but again came back to life - this time thanks to the power of Seal Stone. The repeated trauma has made her mentally unstable, and her sole purpose now is the protection of the Seal Stone. She longs for eternal rest. Demons Lv. 9 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Demons. M. Atk. +10 Atk. Spd. +5% Vampiric Rage effect +1% Bow Skill Vampiric Rage effect +2% Resistance to Dark +10% P. Def. -5% Resistance to Holy -10% Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. Dark Attack Lv. 1 Unleashes a dark attack. Dark Attack Resistance Lv. 5 Resistant to Dark attacks. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
